<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/>
<view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}">
<view class="eyebrow">YOUR STORY, YOUR CHOICE</view><view class="heading">分享多少，由你决定。</view><view class="subtitle">认真保护你的每一份记录。</view><view class="hero section"><view class="row"><view class="grow"><text class="pill light">隐私，由自己掌握</text><view class="hero-title">健康记录，属于你自己。</view><view class="hero-desc">体重、食物照片与完整档案不会出现在公开榜。</view></view><view class="icon-box large"><image class="icon" src="/images/ui/shield.svg"/></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!signedIn}}" class="card section"><view class="empty">登录后管理你的公开展示偏好。</view><button class="btn" data-url="/pages/account/index" bindtap="go">使用模拟账号体验</button></view><view wx:else class="card section"><view class="switch-row"><view class="grow"><view class="title">参加公开坚持榜</view><text class="caption">默认关闭。开启后公开昵称与累计签到天数；关闭后从榜单移除。</text></view><switch color="#1d6651" checked="{{privacy.publicRank}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindchange="toggleRank"/></view><view class="form-hint">当前设置只影响本机模拟榜单。</view><button class="btn soft mt" data-url="/pages/rank/index" bindtap="go">查看打卡坚持榜 ›</button></view><view class="card section"><view class="switch-row"><view class="grow"><view class="title">参加累计减重榜</view><text class="caption">只公开累计减重公斤数，不公开原始体重；默认关闭。</text></view><switch checked="{{privacy.lossRank}}" color="#1d6651" bindchange="toggleLoss"/></view><button class="btn soft mt" data-url="/pages/share/index" bindtap="go">海报生成与体重展示偏好 ›</button></view><view class="section"><view class="section-title mb">你的资料，谁能看见</view><view class="card"><view class="privacy-line"><text class="pill">仅自己</text><view class="grow"><view class="title">个人健康档案</view><text class="caption">身高、目标体重、体重记录、饮食照片、热量和运动明细。</text></view></view><view class="privacy-line"><text class="pill gold">需开启</text><view class="grow"><view class="title">公开坚持榜</view><text class="caption">仅昵称与累计签到天数，不展示原始体重及健康照片。</text></view></view><view class="privacy-line"><text class="pill">本机保存</text><view class="grow"><view class="title">模拟账号的数据</view><text class="caption">记录和照片不上传服务端；更换设备或清理缓存后无法自动恢复。</text></view></view></view></view><view class="section"><view class="section-title mb">重新开始，也很好</view><view class="card"><view class="title">重置演示数据</view><view class="caption">清除本机模拟账号的档案、健康记录、签到、报名、奖励、权益及本应用保存的照片，然后退出模拟账号。此操作无法撤销。</view><button class="btn danger mt" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="reset">清除并重新体验</button></view></view><view class="notice warn section">当前为开发演示版本。真实登录、云端同步和服务端隐私控制将在后端接入后提供。</view>
</block><view class="footnote">轻动 · 每一步坚持，都值得被看见</view></view>
